      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WINSOME SHARK (4) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (30.01) at this track behind Hawkesbury Honey in a Mix. Turned chasing the leaders but kept coming. Safe beginner but has a tricky box to overcome. Good form should continue. HIGH CURRENT (1) was strongly fancied latest and proved too good with a 7 length win at Dubbo in a handy 30.13. Draws the cherry and in form and has the ability. Winner at his latest appearance in one of the quickest times on the card. Significant danger. RARE EARTH (8) could not have been more impressive last start in his speedy 18.18 win at this track in a Grade 5 over 320m. Has the ability and looks a key chance. GLORIA ROCKET (5) scored last time and appeals as a top-three prospect.",
